  "raw_text": "Call Transcript: User: I'm going to go to the mall and take a picture. Agent: I am here to collect information about your food preferences to complete the onboarding so you can get rewarded. To start, please say your name and/or Prolific ID. User: Jay. Agent: Thank you, Jay. What is your favorite fast-food item, including the chain and the exact item? And could you tell me why you like it? User: In-N-Out Burger, cheeseburgers because they are good. Agent: Okay, In-N-Out Burger cheeseburgers. Could you tell me a bit more about what makes them good for you? I'm interested in details like the flavor, texture, temperature, smell, and even the aftertaste. User: I enjoy the flavor of the Thousand Island sauce that is put on the burgers Agent: That's interesting. So the Thousand Island sauce is a big part of the appeal. What are the top two or three things that make that In-N-Out cheeseburger \"perfect\" for you? For example, is it a crunchy coating, a specific sauce balance, the heat level, o",
